# Transitional baseline for the legacy logging migration.
# Silences the deprecation emitted when CentreonLog, CentreonUserLog and
# Centreon\Domain\Log\Logger delegate to Adaptation\Log\Logger.
# Remove this file once those three classes are deleted.
%"(CentreonLog|CentreonUserLog|Centreon\\Domain\\Log\\Logger)" that is deprecated.*Adaptation\\Log\\Logger%
